        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ACCESS_CONTROL",
            "message": "Access control: Access to the dashboard is limited to authorized personnel only and data access can be limited based on role-based permissions.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANALYZE_PERFORMANCE",
            "message": "Analyze the campaign performance data by drilling down from province to district to administrative post to locality to village level using the available charts.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_DASHBOARD_USECASE_A",
            "message": "A dashboard is a visual representation of performance metrics and data related to a healthcare campaign. It provides an easy-to-understand overview of the campaign's performance and monitoring the campaign. The data presented on the dashboard is aggregated and anonymized, ensuring the confidentiality of individual households and population data.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_DASHBOARD_USECASE_B",
            "message": "The dashboard also enables analysis of the campaign's performance at various levels and provides visualizations such as graphs and heat maps. Using a dashboard can help health campaign platform users make informed decisions, improve the campaign's effectiveness, and ensure efficient delivery of healthcare services and interventions to the target population.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_DATA_SECURITY",
            "message": "To ensure the security of data in the dashboard, several measures are implemented, including:",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_GET_ALTERNATIVE",
            "message": "Alternatively, the country may have developed its own digital means of providing information to the dashboard or may use a platform similar to DIGIT. In any case, having a digital platform for managing and monitoring the healthcare campaign is essential for tracking progress and ensuring that the campaign's objectives are met.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_GET_CAMPAIGN",
            "message": "In the healthcare campaign, Field Level Workers (FLWs) are responsible for collecting and inputting data related to households and citizens. This data is crucial in analyzing the performance of the campaign, identifying areas that require attention and monitoring progress.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_GET_CAMPAIGN_FLW",
            "message": "The FLWs share this data while providing campaign services and interventions, enabling the system to collect relevant data at the ground level. The data collected by the FLWs is then used to create a comprehensive overview of the campaign's performance, which is presented on the campaign dashboard.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_GET_HCM",
            "message": "The healthcare campaign management service in the country is based on DIGIT, a platform that provides tools to manage healthcare campaigns effectively. This platform streamlines the process of data collection, storage, and analysis, making it easier for FLWs and boundary-level users to input data into the system. The platform also provides tools to generate reports and visualizations, making it easier to monitor the campaign's performance and identify areas for improvement.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ANS_GET_MANAGERS",
            "message": "Supervisors and warehouse managers, who are boundary-level users, also play a crucial role in providing datasets required for the dashboard. They contribute to the dashboard by providing data on the supply chain, stock management, and other relevant information. The datasets provided by these users are combined with the data collected by the FLWs to create a comprehensive picture of the healthcare campaign's performance.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
