        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_DASHBOARD",
            "message": "About the Dashboard",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_DASHBOARD_DESIGN",
            "message": "The dashboard is designed to present a summary of the data collected through the front line app used for the delivery of health interventions. The data is aggregated, meaning it has been compiled and processed to create a comprehensive overview of the healthcare campaign's performance. The information presented on the dashboard does not contain any personally identifiable details, such as Team worker names or any personal detail.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_DASHBOARD_OBJECTIVE",
            "message": "The primary objective of the dashboard is to provide an overview of the health campaign's performance. The dashboard uses specific identifiers to categorize and organize the data, making it easier for viewers to understand and interpret the information presented.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_DASHBOARD_USE",
            "message": "With the Health Campaign Management Dashboard, users can quickly identify campaign progress, generate detailed summary reports with a single click, and measure the campaign coverage, and identify potential roadblocks. This information can help users to plan stock requirements and identify areas for planning future campaigns. Additionally, the dashboard enables users to track the progress rate of healthcare campaign services.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_DASHBOARD_USE_IDENTIFIERS",
            "message": "Using these identifiers, the dashboard can showcase the strengths and weaknesses of the healthcare campaign across various districts, administrative posts, localities or villages in the provinces, highlighting areas that require further attention and improvement.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_DATA_MASKING",
            "message": "Data masking: The sensitive data is masked to protect personally identifiable information, and only authorized personnel can access the unmasked data.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_ENCRYPTION",
            "message": "Encryption: The data transmitted to and from the dashboard is encrypted using secure communication protocols, such as HTTPS or SSL, to protect against interception and unauthorized access. The data can be encrypted to prevent unauthorized access and ensure data confidentiality. This can be done using secure encryption protocols such as AES or RSA.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_FOLLOWING_VIEWER_DO_ON_DASHBOARD",
