        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_ABOUT_REGULAR_SECURITY_AUDITS",
            "message": "Regular security audits: Regular security audits should be conducted to ensure that the dashboard remains secure and to identify and fix any security vulnerabilities that may arise.",
