        {
            "code": "DSS_CALCULATION_REGISTRATION_AND_DELIVERY_SUMMARY_REPORT_BOUNDARY_ONE",
            "message": "The summary report provides an overview of the progress of the campaign in different boundaries such as district, administrative post, for different metrics such as household coverage, population coverage, and bed nets distribution.",
